<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"Bursa\u2019da Saadet co\u015fkusu: Mahmut Ar\u0131kan Y\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131m Kongresi\u2019nde konu\u015ftu","articleSection":"Bursa","dateCreated":"2026-09-27T18:21:00+03:00","datePublished":"2026-09-27T18:21:00+03:00","dateModified":"2026-09-27T19:07:04+03:00","wordCount":573,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.bursasaati.com.tr\/bursada-saadet-coskusu-mahmut-arikan-yildirim-kongresinde-konustu"},"articleBody":"BURHAN KURTULMU\u015e \/ BURSA SAAT\u0130\r\n\r\nKongrede konu\u015fan Saadet Partisi Y\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131m \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Nuri Ke\u00e7eli, kongrelerin te\u015fkilatlar\u0131n azmini tazeledi\u011fi ve yeni bir d\u00f6nemin ba\u015flat\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131 \u00f6nemli d\u00f6n\u00fcm noktalar\u0131 oldu\u011funu s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u201cYA\u015eANAB\u0130L\u0130R B\u0130R YILDIRIM HEDEFL\u0130YORUZ\u201d\r\n\r\nY\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131m\u2019\u0131n farkl\u0131 b\u00f6lgelerden gelen insanlar\u0131n birlikte ya\u015fad\u0131\u011f\u0131 bir karde\u015flik merkezi oldu\u011funu belirten Ke\u00e7eli, il\u00e7enin mevcut sorunlar\u0131na dikkat \u00e7ekti. Ke\u00e7eli, \u00e7arp\u0131k kentle\u015fme, altyap\u0131 yetersizli\u011fi, kentsel d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f\u00fcm ma\u011fduriyetleri, gen\u00e7lerin kar\u015f\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131ya kald\u0131\u011f\u0131 sosyal sorunlar ve ekonomik s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131n Y\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131m\u2019da ciddi sorun alanlar\u0131 olu\u015fturdu\u011funu ifade etti.\r\n\r\nSaadet Partisi olarak \u201cgelenekten gelece\u011fe yeni bir siyaset anlay\u0131\u015f\u0131yla ya\u015fanabilir bir Y\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131m\u201d hedeflediklerini belirten Ke\u00e7eli, siyaset anlay\u0131\u015flar\u0131n\u0131n sorun \u00fcretmek yerine \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcm \u00fcretmeye, ahlak ve maneviyat temelinde hizmet etmeye dayand\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\nKe\u00e7eli, \u201cAdil payla\u015f\u0131m\u0131, r\u00fc\u015fvetsiz ve \u015feffaf y\u00f6netimi, \u00f6nce ahlak ve maneviyat ilkesini Y\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131m\u2019\u0131n merkezine koyaca\u011f\u0131z\u201d dedi.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u201cYILDIRIM\u2019DAN BA\u015eLAYARAK DE\u011e\u0130\u015eT\u0130RECE\u011e\u0130Z\u201d\r\n\r\nSaadet Partisi Bursa \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Hamza G\u00fcrsel ise T\u00fcrkiye\u2019de ve Bursa\u2019da ya\u015fanan ekonomik ve sosyal sorunlara ili\u015fkin de\u011ferlendirmelerde bulundu.\r\n\r\nG\u00fcrsel, iktidar\u0131n politikalar\u0131n\u0131n ekonomik ve sosyal sorunlar\u0131n ortaya \u00e7\u0131kmas\u0131nda etkili oldu\u011funu savunarak, yolsuzluk iddialar\u0131, ge\u00e7im s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131, kentle\u015fme ve imar politikalar\u0131 \u00fczerinden ele\u015ftiriler y\u00f6neltti.\r\n\r\nBursa ve \u00f6zellikle Y\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131m\u2019da insanlar\u0131n daha s\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131k ya\u015fam ko\u015fullar\u0131na mahk\u00fbm edildi\u011fini ileri s\u00fcren G\u00fcrsel, \u015fehirlerin insanlara insanca ya\u015fayabilecekleri ko\u015fullar\u0131 sunmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u201c\u0130NSANLARIN DERTLER\u0130YLE DERTLENECE\u011e\u0130Z\u201d\r\n\r\nSiyasetin insanlarla ileti\u015fim kurarak ve onlar\u0131n sorunlar\u0131n\u0131 dinleyerek yap\u0131lmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini belirten G\u00fcrsel, Saadet Partisi te\u015fkilatlar\u0131n\u0131n vatanda\u015flara ula\u015f\u0131rken kavga ve \u00e7at\u0131\u015fma yerine diyalog anlay\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 benimseyece\u011fini s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\nG\u00fcrsel, Y\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131m te\u015fkilat\u0131n\u0131n k\u0131s\u0131tl\u0131 imk\u00e2nlarla y\u00fcr\u00fctt\u00fc\u011f\u00fc \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalara da dikkat \u00e7ekerek, mahalle ve sivil toplum \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131 ba\u015fta olmak \u00fczere te\u015fkilat mensuplar\u0131n\u0131n \u00f6zverili \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131ndan dolay\u0131 te\u015fekk\u00fcr etti.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u201cTOPLUMDAK\u0130 UMUDU B\u00dcY\u00dcT\u00dcYORUZ\u201d\r\n\r\nSaadet Partisi Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mahmut Ar\u0131kan da kongrede yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 konu\u015fmada, toplumdaki en \u00f6nemli sorunlardan birinin gelece\u011fe ili\u015fkin umutsuzluk oldu\u011funu s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\n\u00dcye say\u0131s\u0131ndaki art\u0131\u015f\u0131n tek ba\u015f\u0131na yeterli olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirten Ar\u0131kan, siyasette topluma yeniden umut kazand\u0131rman\u0131n \u00f6nemine dikkat \u00e7ekti. Saadet Partisi te\u015fkilatlar\u0131n\u0131n s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 imk\u00e2nlarla \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131n\u0131 s\u00fcrd\u00fcrd\u00fc\u011f\u00fcn\u00fc ifade eden Ar\u0131kan, ortaya konulan performans\u0131n toplumdaki umudu b\u00fcy\u00fctt\u00fc\u011f\u00fcn\u00fc s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAr\u0131kan, \u201cHazine imk\u00e2nlar\u0131yla de\u011fil, inanm\u0131\u015f te\u015fkilatlar\u0131m\u0131zla, Allah ne der diye \u00e7al\u0131\u015fan te\u015fkilatlar\u0131m\u0131zla, imanla ve azimle bu \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131 ortaya koyuyoruz\u201d ifadelerini kulland\u0131.\r\n\r\nBursa te\u015fkilatlar\u0131na te\u015fekk\u00fcr eden Ar\u0131kan, Y\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131m \u0130l\u00e7e Kongresi\u2019nin hay\u0131rl\u0131 olmas\u0131n\u0131 diledi.\r\n\r\nKongrede yap\u0131lan se\u00e7im sonucunda Nuri Ke\u00e7eli yeniden Saadet Partisi Y\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131m \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 g\u00f6revine se\u00e7ilerek g\u00fcven tazeledi.","description":"Saadet Partisi Y\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131m \u0130l\u00e7e Kongresi, Genel Ba\u015fkan Mahmut Ar\u0131kan\u2019\u0131n kat\u0131l\u0131m\u0131yla yo\u011fun ve co\u015fkulu bir atmosferde ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirildi. Salonun tamamen doldu\u011fu\u2026","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":[],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/bursasaaticomtr.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/bursasaati-com-tr\/uploads\/2026\/09\/whatsapp-image-2026-09-27-at-190057-2.jpg","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"Bursa\u2019da Saadet co\u015fkusu: Mahmut Ar\u0131kan Y\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131m Kongresi\u2019nde konu\u015ftu"},"isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.bursasaati.com.tr\/#organization","name":"Bursa Saati Gazetesi","image":"https:\/\/bursasaaticomtr.teimg.com\/bursasaati-com-tr\/uploads\/2025\/05\/wmdw.jpg","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/bursasaaticomtr.teimg.com\/bursasaati-com-tr\/uploads\/2025\/05\/wmdw.jpg","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Burhan Kurtulmu\u015f","url":"https:\/\/www.bursasaati.com.tr\/muhabir\/32\/burhan-kurtulmus"},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"\u015eule Baydar","url":"https:\/\/www.bursasaati.com.tr\/muhabir\/37\/sule-baydar"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.bursasaati.com.tr\/#organization","name":"Bursa Saati Gazetesi","url":"https:\/\/www.bursasaati.com.tr"}}</script>


